      {
        id: 'be-nginx',
        title: 'Nginx 配置与运维',
        level: '高级',
        content: `**核心配置结构**
\`\`\`nginx
worker_processes auto;
events {
    worker_connections 1024;
}
http {
    include mime.types;
    sendfile on;
    keepalive_timeout 65;

    upstream backend {
        server 127.0.0.1:5000;
        server 127.0.0.1:5001;
    }

    server {
        listen 80;
        server_name example.com;

        location / {
            root /var/www/html;
            index index.html;
            try_files $uri $uri/ =404;
        }

        location /api/ {
            proxy_pass http://backend;
            proxy_set_header Host $host;
            proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        }

        location ~ \\.(jpg|png|css|js)$ {
            expires 30d;
        }
    }
}
\`\`\`

**常用功能**
- 静态资源服务
- 反向代理：proxy_pass
- 负载均衡：upstream（轮询、权重、ip_hash、least_conn）
- HTTPS：listen 443 ssl + ssl_certificate
- Gzip 压缩：gzip on
- 限流：limit_req_zone
- 重定向：rewrite

**常用命令**
\`\`\`bash
nginx -t                # 检查配置
nginx -s reload         # 重载
nginx -s stop
systemctl restart nginx
\`\`\`

**日志**：access.log、error.log，可通过 log_format 自定义格式。`
